	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Gratiam et vitae innocentiam a domino.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Negotia hactenus obstiterunt, <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>quominus scripserim, at nunc paucis ad singula<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Nämlich im Brief von <persName ref="p8418">Myconius</persName> an ihn, 20. Juli 1533, oben <ref target="file10275">Nr. 244</ref>.</note> <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>respondebo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Video autem nimis verum esse, quod trito fertur pro<lb xml:id="p1z4"/>verbio, de calamitosis inauspicatissima quaeque narrari semper<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2">Etwa im Sinne des deutschen Sprichwortes: «Wer Unglück hat, braucht für Spott nicht zu sorgen.»</note>.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z5"/>Calamitosi sane sumus, sed non in iis, quae impinguntur nobis.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z6"/>Nam certa spes est nostros nihil negotii cum <placeName ref="l832">Gallo</placeName> hab<lb xml:id="p1z7"/>ituros.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><pb type="edition" next="167"/>Cur autem nuper<note xml:id="fna" type="footnote" n="a">nuper <hi>am Rande nachgetragen.</hi></note> receperint nuncii nostri viri alias boni <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>coronatos aliquot, et quid praeterea actum sit super eo n<lb xml:id="p1z9"/>egotio<note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3">Siehe oben S. 164, 10f.</note>, procul dubio non nescis.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Iam quod de advenis et <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>exulibus et profugis urbe et agro expellendis narrasti, longe <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>alio instituto coeptum<note xml:id="fnb" type="footnote" n="b">coeptum <hi>am Rande nachgetragen.</hi></note> est, quod lator<note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4">Unbekannt.</note> praesentium exponet.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z12"/>Quodsi praeterea adversum <placeName ref="l41">Bern[enses]</placeName> a nostris quidpiam<note xml:id="fnc" type="footnote" n="c">quidpiam <hi>am Rande nachgetragen.</hi></note> institui coepit, <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>universi nescimus, nec timemus quidpiam posse in<lb xml:id="p1z14"/>stitui.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Ager enim totus, denique cives universi <placeName ref="l41">Bernatibus</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>melius volunt, quam ut paucorum (quam tamen nescimus) <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>conspiratio nocere possit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Libros nostros olim adversus <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>catabaptistas<note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5">«Von dem unverschämten Frevel der Wiedertäufer», 1531 (<bibl source="b286">HBBibl</bibl> I 28).</note> rudi Minerva<note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6">Mit roher Hand oder derbem Verstand, vgl. <bibl source="b56">Adagia</bibl>, 1, 1, 37 (<bibl source="b370">LB</bibl> II 42); <bibl source="b473">Otto</bibl> 224, Nr. 1119.</note> conscriptos mitto.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">De <persName ref="p5618">La<lb xml:id="p1z18"/>vatero</persName><note xml:id="fn7" type="footnote" n="7"><persName ref="p5618">Heinrich Lavater</persName>, s. oben S. 157, 28f.</note> non est, quod aliud expectes.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Manebit adhuc apud <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>me.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Egit tamen gratias <persName ref="p1888">Lavaterus</persName><note xml:id="fn8" type="footnote" n="8"><persName ref="p1888">Hans Rudolf Lavater</persName>, s. ebenda.</note>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Non desperamus, de gratia <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>domini subinde meliora speramus.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Semel humiliavit <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>dominus, exaltabit denuo<note xml:id="fn9" type="footnote" n="9">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>Mt 23, 12</ref></cit>; <cit type="bible"><ref>Jak 4, 10</ref></cit>.</note>, si illi fuerit visum, quamquam <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>nullam exaltationem cupiamus, quam quae tyrannidi <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>quorundam eximeret.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Sed fiat voluntas domini<note xml:id="fn10" type="footnote" n="10">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>Mt 6, 10</ref></cit>.</note>.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z24"/>Orato pro nobis dominum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName>, 18. augusti 1533.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z25"/><persName ref="p495">Heinrychus</persName> tuus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z26"/>Lieber, habend ir gewüsse bottschaff[t] <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>gen <placeName ref="l59">Burgis</placeName> inn <placeName ref="l832">Franckrych</placeName>, so lassend <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>michs wüssen; so wölltend wir unsernn <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>knaben<note xml:id="fn11" type="footnote" ana="bio" n="11"><persName ref="p1283">Konrad Geßner</persName> und <persName ref="p1214">Johannes Fries</persName>, die seit April 1533 in <placeName ref="l59">Bourges</placeName> studierten, s. oben <ref target="file10241">Nr. 210</ref> und 224.</note> gällt rüsten, inen ze schickenn.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse auf der Rückseite:]</note>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Domino <persName ref="p8418">Oswaldo Myconio</persName>, <placeName ref="l28">Basileiensis</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>ecclesiae praesuli vigilantissimo, fratri <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>in domino observando.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
